OL,3,AWoman whose XL bully dog killed her
OL,4,Acousin given suspended prison sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been given a suspended
OL,7,Fprison sentence after her XL bully dog
OL,8,Fattacked and killed her cousin.
OL,10,FKelcie Reed, 24, of Bristol, previously
OL,11,Fadmitted being in charge of a dog
OL,12,Fdangerously out control, causing the
OL,13,Fdeath of Morgan Dorsett.
OL,15,FThe 19-year-old, from Shrewsbury, died
OL,16,Ffrom neck injuries caused by the
OL,17,Fattack, which happened at Reed's flat
OL,18,Fin south Bristol in February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
